{"id":"9538412e70727870","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity.md","title":"邻域函数给出连续数值泛函","display":"thm-neighborhood-function-continuity — 邻域函数给出连续数值泛函","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity","aliases":["72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity"],"display":"thm-neighborhood-function-continuity — 邻域函数给出连续数值泛函","depends_on":["[[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.6, print426/PDF438; local cylinder proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_deep":"补出首个正邻域长度的局部不变性"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-neighborhood-function-continuity — 邻域函数给出连续数值泛函"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54bd0de31af513e7\" href=\"?note=54bd0de31af513e7\" title=\"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function\">72-df-baire-neighborhood-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.6, print426/PDF438; local cylinder proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"补出首个正邻域长度的局部不变性"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54bd0de31af513e7\" href=\"?note=54bd0de31af513e7\" title=\"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function\">72-df-baire-neighborhood-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NB}\">\\(\\operatorname{NB}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\gamma,\\mu_\\gamma\">\\(F_\\gamma,\\mu_\\gamma\\)</span> 沿用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\quad\n\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_\\gamma(\\alpha)=F_\\gamma(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\quad\n\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_\\gamma(\\alpha)=F_\\gamma(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\mu_\\gamma(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\mu_\\gamma(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一有限前缀已经有相同正值。两条分支的最早正值位置不必预先假定相同：较早的正值由稳定性延续到共同前缀，从而其值与共同前缀值一致。因此两个输出相同。这给出逐点有限前缀的连续性模量；没有声称存在对全部 Baire 空间统一的有限长度界。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：共同前缀处已为正，故 β 的首次正值不晚于该长度；其每个更短前缀与 α 相同且为零，所以也不能更早。这个更强的局部长度等式直接支撑原有连续性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function","status":"resolved","id":"54bd0de31af513e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function","status":"resolved","id":"54bd0de31af513e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\gamma$ 满足 [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] 的 $\\operatorname{NB}$，$F_\\gamma,\\mu_\\gamma$ 沿用；$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NB}","display":false},{"tex":"F_\\gamma,\\mu_\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\quad\n\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_\\gamma(\\alpha)=F_\\gamma(\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)=\\mu_\\gamma(\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":1999,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt"